%% Format split — paste into https://mermaid.live
flowchart TB
  IN[Object in landing zone]
  CLS{Classifier: MIME, page count, scanned?}

  IN --> CLS

  CLS -->|image PDF / mixed| OCR[OCR path: Textract or equivalent]
  CLS -->|digital PDF| TXTP[Text + structure extraction]
  CLS -->|xlsx/csv| TAB[Tabular path: pandas or Spark]
  CLS -->|docx| DOC[Word adapter]
  CLS -->|sqlite| SQL[SQLite snapshot adapter]
  CLS -->|txt/eml| NER[Text chunk + entity path]
  CLS -->|unknown| Q[Quarantine]

  OCR --> LAY[Layout registry lookup or discovery]
  TXTP --> LAY
  TAB --> SIL[Silver writer]
  DOC --> SIL
  SQL --> SIL
  NER --> SIL
  LAY --> SIL
